        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Available construction material and energy data refer to a model plant in early 1980s.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes: estimated land use of a plant with capacity of 1500 t SWU (separative work unit); energy (electricity, diesel, and light oil) and material requirements for the construction of the facility; transport requirements during construction; energy and transport requirements (for non-contaminated inerts concrete with reinforcing bars) during decommissioning; disposal of the non-contaminated inerts. The non contaminated metals are assumed to be recycled.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
    </processInformation>
